                                        "value": {
                                            "code": null,
                                            "comment": "",
                                            "message": "<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; padding-left: 16px;\">\n<li>Review the list of predicted skipped records and decide which versions of the files you'd like to keep.</li>\n<li>You can choose to revert some customizations to their base versions, allowing them to go through the upgrade without getting skipped.</li>\n<li>Be aware that you will need to review and make changes to the definitive list of skipped records after the upgrade.</li>\n<li>After reviewing skipped records in the Preview tool, come back to this guided steps to schedule your upgrade.</li>\n</ul>"
                                        }
